{"kind":"symbol","variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/pushwooshcore\/pwconfiguration\/settags:"]}],"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore","doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration"]]},"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"PushwooshCore"}],"role":"symbol","title":"setTags:","fragments":[{"text":"+ ","kind":"text"},{"text":"setTags:","kind":"identifier"}],"roleHeading":"Type Method","externalID":"c:objc(pl)PWConfiguration(cm)setTags:","symbolKind":"method","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"setTags:","kind":"identifier"}]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Sets user tags for device segmentation."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"+ (","kind":"text"},{"text":"void","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:v"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"text":"setTags:","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)NSDictionary","text":"NSDictionary","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" *) ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"tags"},{"text":";","kind":"text"}],"platforms":["iOS"],"languages":["occ"]}]},{"parameters":[{"name":"tags","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Dictionary of tag names and values to set for the current device"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"kind":"parameters"},{"content":[{"text":"Discussion","level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Tags are key-value pairs that enable targeted push notifications based on user attributes"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"and behavior. Use tags to segment your audience and send personalized messages to specific","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"user groups.","type":"text"}]},{"anchor":"Supported-Tag-Types","text":"Supported Tag Types","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"table","rows":[[[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Type","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Example","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Description"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"String","type":"text"}]}],[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"\"city\": \"New York\"","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Text values"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Integer"}]}],[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"\"age\": 25","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Numeric values"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Boolean"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\"isPremium\": true"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"True\/false values"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"List","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\"interests\": [\"sports\", \"music\"]"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Arrays of strings","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Date","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"\"lastPurchase\": Date()","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"NSDate objects"}],"type":"paragraph"}]]],"header":"row"},{"level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Example","text":"Example"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Update user profile tags after account changes:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["class UserProfileManager {","","    func updateUserTags(for user: User) {","        var tags: [String: Any] = [","            \"user_id\": user.id,","            \"email_verified\": user.isEmailVerified,","            \"account_type\": user.accountType.rawValue,","            \"signup_date\": user.createdAt,","            \"app_version\": Bundle.main.appVersion","        ]","","        \/\/ Add subscription info if premium","        if let subscription = user.subscription {","            tags[\"subscription_tier\"] = subscription.tier.rawValue","            tags[\"subscription_expiry\"] = subscription.expiryDate","            tags[\"is_premium\"] = true","        } else {","            tags[\"is_premium\"] = false","        }","","        \/\/ Add user preferences","        if !user.interests.isEmpty {","            tags[\"interests\"] = user.interests","        }","","        \/\/ Add location if available","        if let location = user.location {","            tags[\"country\"] = location.country","            tags[\"city\"] = location.city","            tags[\"timezone\"] = location.timezone","        }","","        Pushwoosh.configure.setTags(tags)","        Logger.debug(\"User tags updated: \\(tags.keys.joined(separator: \", \"))\")","    }","","    func trackPurchase(product: Product, amount: Decimal) {","        Pushwoosh.configure.setTags([","            \"last_purchase_date\": Date(),","            \"last_purchase_amount\": NSDecimalNumber(decimal: amount),","            \"last_purchase_category\": product.category,","            \"total_purchases\": incrementTag(\"total_purchases\")","        ])","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"}],"kind":"content"}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"occ","url":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration\/setTags:"},"references":{"doc://com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore/documentation/PushwooshCore/PWConfiguration":{"title":"PWConfiguration","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration","fragments":[{"text":"PWConfiguration","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/pushwooshcore\/pwconfiguration","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol"},"doc://com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore/documentation/PushwooshCore/PWConfiguration/setTags:":{"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/pushwooshcore\/pwconfiguration\/settags:","type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"+ ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"setTags:"}],"title":"setTags:","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Sets user tags for device segmentation."}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"setTags:","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration\/setTags:","role":"symbol"},"doc://com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore/documentation/PushwooshCore":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore","kind":"symbol","title":"PushwooshCore","url":"\/documentation\/pushwooshcore","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Core foundation module for Pushwoosh SDK."}],"type":"topic","role":"collection"}}}